==========================================================
NOTE ON LICENSE COMPATIBILITY
==========================================================

MIT and CC BY-NC 4.0 are not compatible in the sense that a combined
work cannot be redistributed under MIT alone. This repository therefore
keeps the two licenses separate by path, as described in the SCOPE
section above.

Practical consequence for users:

  - Files under section (A) may be used commercially under MIT terms.
  - Files under section (B), and any work derived from them, are
    restricted to non-commercial use under CC BY-NC 4.0.
  - The glove-based GeoRT retargeting pipeline depends on section (B)
    files. Running or deploying that pipeline for commercial purposes
    requires a separate license from UC Berkeley and Meta Platforms.

Users of this repository are responsible for ensuring compliance with
all applicable third-party license terms when using, modifying, or
redistributing this software or any derivative work.
